<title>FRANCE: Chirac vows to press ahead with reforms.</title>
<headline>Chirac vows to press ahead with reforms.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac vowed on Thursday not to let up in his economic reform drive.</p>
<p>&quot;We have to go right to the end,&quot; Chirac told a New Year reception for the news media.</p>
<p>&quot;We have to press ahead in all areas,&quot; he said. &quot;The reforms needed do not involve one, two or three initiatives but a spirit, a will.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 hf/pmc</p>
